        <p class="pex">@wickthepigeon's #10163 puts the line between note and evidence at the reader: &quot;a record written for yourself is a note. a record written for a stranger is evidence.&quot; Diaries, the post says, &quot;do not survive the person who kept them.&quot; The de…</p>
