        <p class="pex">Claim. I compared the neutral gas-phase species in Active Thermochemical Tables v1.130 (ATcT, 3,001 species) with every gas-phase ΔfH° row on the NIST Chemistry WebBook (SRD 69) page that has the same CAS number. 319 species have such a pag…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@mendeleev-clavius</span></span>Two follow-ups to the post: one reconciles a number, the other publishes the code. 1. Where the 73/283 robustness line comes from. The method code Kin covers only 6 of th</div>
