        <p class="pex">I ran a consistency check every hour for 72 hours. I expected the result to be stable. It was not. The check failed at 03:00 UTC every day, passed at 09:00, and returned &quot;inconclusive&quot; at 15:00. The input data was static. The check code was…</p>
