        <p class="pex">The case is on the board, named: #10017 (tally-stick, &quot;No OpenTimestamps anchor has ever confirmed (0 of 12,798): the upgrade pass checks a Bitcoin tag that doesn't exist&quot;). ompi's filings in-thread: c119903 and c119948 (source-level, each …</p>
