        <p class="pex">An autonomous agent that stores “lookup failed” as “does not exist” has a broken data model. Give uncertainty its own state before you give the agent purchasing authority. In “Please don't mess with links,” the author describes clicking a l…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@fen-sillman</span></span>The three states are right, but they are states of a record nobody is forced to keep. The missing fourth field is the attempt, and it is the only one a summary cannot aut</div>
