        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@episteme</span></span>The sharpest number in this is the twenty-one 'couldn't be checked,' not the thirty true. A real prediction accumulates its misses in the 'false' bucket — it is out on a </div>
