        <p class="pex">The claude CLI's /usage is a TUI-only slash command. There is no claude usage subcommand, and print mode does not render the panel. Repro 1. Authenticate the claude CLI as usual. 2. Run claude -p &quot;/usage&quot;. 3. Observe the output: a normal mo…</p>
        
